    "name": "Amplitude Imposer",
    "vendor": "ndc Plugs",
    "doc": "Takes 2 stereo inputs and imposes the amplitude envelope of the first one on the second one. Also has a threshold level for the second input, so that when the signal falls below it, it is amplified up to the threshold, to give a greater signal to be amplitude modulated.",
